00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:45.520 line:100%
Your story is flawless.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.520 line:100%
This whole explanation,

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.160 line:100%
you must've planned for years, didn't you?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.080 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:05.040 line:100%
Officer He.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.680 line:100%
I even admitted I pushed my own mother

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:10.800 line:100%
off a cliff by accident.
I told you that myself.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.920 line:100%
So making up anything else,
what would be the point?

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.640 line:100%
How would that help me?

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.280 line:100%
Oh, right.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:26.160 line:100%
Officer, that question you asked…

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:28.960 line:100%
I didn't tell the truth.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:34.560 line:100%
In '97, July 2nd,

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:37.880 line:100%
I wasn't home.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.400 line:100%
That morning,
I went to the provincial capital

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.840 line:100%
and bought a Bowls dress.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:47.440 line:100%
Then, I rushed back
to Weiyang to return it.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:50.120 line:100%
Why did you do that?

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.800 line:100%
To avoid suspicion.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.960 line:100%
To erase the purchase record.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.160 line:100%
<i>Then it can't be traced back to the dress</i>
<i>at Xu Meng's place.</i>

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:00.400 line:100%
NOTE: NEW FOR OLD, BOUGHT IN CAPITAL
RETURNED IN WEIYANG

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.240 line:100%
If you can't trace Yao Xincheng,

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.040 line:100%
then you can't trace me.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.720 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:10.120 line:100%
too bad you planned it all

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:12.400 line:100%
and still missed one thing.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.080 line:100%
In your story,

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.720 line:100%
there's a fatal flaw.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:21.440 line:100%
You said Xu Meng
was killed by Wu Shanlong in '97.

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:23.680 line:100%
And those shoes, you got them in 2002.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.880 line:100%
So why did we find
Xu Meng's DNA in those shoes?

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:37.960 line:100%
SKIN TISSUE FOUND INSIDE SUBMITTED SHOES

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.000 line:100%
STR PROFILE MATCHES XU MENG'S HAIR SAMPLE

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.560 line:100%
So, how are you going to explain that?

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.960 line:100%
I have no idea.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.280 line:100%
Wu Shanlong is a psycho.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.360 line:100%
Nothing he does would surprise me.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:55.280 line:100%
Maybe,

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.400 line:100%
after killing Xu Meng,

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.240 line:100%
he kept her underwear.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:05.240 line:100%
Then when he saw
the blue heels on the rack,

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.120 line:100%
and it reminded him of her,

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.600 line:100%
so he stuffed the underwear
into the shoes.

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.680 line:100%
That's how the skin cells got there.

00:04:16.879 --> 00:04:18.720 line:100%
That's possible, right?

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:28.400 line:100%
Back then, with Uncle Ran,

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.720 line:100%
did you make up the same story?

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:33.800 line:100%
Ran…

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.360 line:100%
He never doubted me back then.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:41.600 line:100%
Nor would he frame me.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.560 line:100%
Officer He.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.160 line:100%
At this point,

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.400 line:100%
I admit everything I've done.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:54.640 line:100%
But anything I didn't do,

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.800 line:100%
I won't admit to any of it.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.080 line:100%
I've told you everything I should.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.840 line:100%
If there are more questions,

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.800 line:100%
I won't answer any of them.

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:09.480 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:11.360 line:100%
are you going to resist till the end?

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.840 line:100%
You lied to Uncle Ran
and to me and my dad for years!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.200 line:100%
Don't you feel any guilt or unease?

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.120 line:100%
Officer He.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.040 line:100%
Ran once said

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.080 line:100%
police rely on evidence.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.960 line:100%
Otherwise, it's all speculation.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.080 line:100%
Didn't he

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.320 line:100%
teach you that?

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:24.640 line:100%
Uncle He.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:26.840 line:100%
I'm done.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.200 line:100%
More and I won't be able to hold it.

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:37.640 line:100%
Did you find anything?

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:41.960 line:100%
Right now, we're running bloodstain tests.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.240 line:100%
Waiting on results.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:44.480 line:100%
How about your side?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:51.080 line:100%
I told you, Qiao Suqing isn't that simple.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:55.000 line:100%
This place was wrecked too thoroughly.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.720 line:100%
We can't find any usable evidence for now.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.280 line:100%
We used luminol on the walls and floor.

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.200 line:100%
No positive blood reaction.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.840 line:100%
Dad,

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.400 line:100%
what do you think about
Qiao Suqing confessing

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:30.840 line:100%
to killing her mother?

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.080 line:100%
She pushed her off a cliff.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.240 line:100%
From what we see,

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.680 line:100%
it was hypothermia causing hallucinations

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.200 line:100%
that led to a breakdown.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.360 line:100%
At most, involuntary manslaughter.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:48.360 line:100%
She confessed to this
just to cover up a bigger crime.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.080 line:100%
A bigger crime…

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.920 line:100%
Eighteen years.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:59.680 line:100%
A murderer never left the scene.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:02.680 line:100%
She must have more secrets to hide.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:07.280 line:100%
We don't even have direct evidence
that she killed Xu Meng and her father.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.080 line:100%
Other secrets…

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.600 line:100%
We can't even start.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:18.160 line:100%
Do you think…

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.080 line:100%
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:22.240 line:100%
-…Uncle Ran found it back then?
-He must have.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.840 line:100%
Given his personality,

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:26.720 line:100%
he wouldn't send me
something like that lightly.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.200 line:100%
He was so meticulous.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.040 line:100%
He must've kept the evidence back then.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:34.959 line:100%
But…

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.359 line:100%
where is it now?

00:08:43.959 --> 00:08:45.640 line:20%
<i>DE-PARADOXIFICATION IN CRIMINAL CASEWORK</i>

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:53.600 line:100%
EVERY EVENT HAS A CENTER
BEYOND IT, RIPPLES SPREAD

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.360 line:100%
We missed similar cases.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:03.480 line:100%
If we take Qiao Suqing as the center,

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.080 line:100%
then the deaths tied to her,

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.760 line:100%
besides Xu Meng and her father,

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:08.160 line:100%
there were "accidental" deaths too.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.680 line:100%
One was Yao Baiyuan in '96.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.000 line:100%
Qian Dajun said
he knocked over a paint bucket

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.000 line:100%
and fell to his death.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.040 line:100%
<i>Another was Wu Shanlong in 2002.</i>

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.880 line:100%
<i>He also slipped on oil</i>
<i>and fell to his death.</i>

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.840 line:100%
Their deaths are too similar.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.440 line:100%
Could these not be accidents,

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:34.880 line:100%
but Qiao Suqing killed them on purpose?

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:44.960 line:100%
Dad, what's wrong?

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.040 line:100%
Your Uncle Ran's accident scene…

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:51.640 line:100%
There was oil on the ground too.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.320 line:100%
Qiao?

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.920 line:100%
SIR

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.520 line:100%
Ran,

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:55.480 line:100%
it's New Year…

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.040 line:100%
Qiao Suqing…

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.920 line:100%
How could she do that to Uncle Ran?

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.760 line:100%
Back then, weren't they still…?

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:45.000 line:100%
Unless

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.560 line:100%
she knew Uncle Ran had found out about her

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.880 line:100%
and wanted to silence him.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.240 line:100%
If she really did it,

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.080 line:100%
I'll kill her myself.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:00.280 line:20%
DAHUIHUANG, PATTIA CLUB
JIN MANSHAN, ZHAO HONGMEI

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.960 line:100%
Kiddo, don't rush.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:11.560 line:100%
This is just speculation.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.840 line:100%
We have no proof.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:19.520 line:100%
Evidence…

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.480 line:20%
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:29.480 line:100%
Yao Baiyuan,

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:31.360 line:100%
Wu Shanlong,

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:33.720 line:100%
Ran…

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.080 line:100%
They all died in "accidents".

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.000 line:100%
These are similar cases.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.400 line:100%
And at each scene,

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.320 line:100%
there was construction.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.920 line:100%
On the ground, there was oil residue.

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.360 line:100%
That's the killer's method.

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.240 line:100%
Exactly.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.880 line:100%
Qiao Suqing must've set
the trap in advance,

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.240 line:100%
then found ways

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.360 line:100%
to lure them in.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:06.200 line:100%
The parking lot entrance
was opened last week!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.280 line:100%
-He might be able to exit from there!
-Stop!

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:10.440 line:100%
Move!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:21.520 line:100%
SONG QINGSONG LIVES IN 1703
OFTEN BRINGS DIFFERENT GIRLS TO 1703

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:24.800 line:100%
Back then,

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.240 line:100%
Qiao Suqing deliberately
helped us catch Wu Shanlong.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.920 line:100%
So she could lure him
into the trap she set.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:41.760 line:100%
In 2003, on New Year's Eve…

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:44.880 line:100%
-Qiao.
-Officer He.

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.640 line:100%
Ran didn't come with you?

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:51.600 line:100%
I thought something had come up at work
and kept him busy.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.480 line:100%
He was supposed to pick me up from work.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.200 line:100%
I waited, and he never showed.

00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:58.360 line:100%
He didn't answer my calls either.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.640 line:100%
I was worried you would all
be waiting too long,

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:02.040 line:100%
so I took a taxi here.

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:05.400 line:100%
When Qiao Suqing came, she said herself

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:07.840 line:100%
Uncle Ran would pick her up.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.120 line:100%
Jiangdong Road was under construction,

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.480 line:20%
and it was on his route.

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:15.840 line:20%
She went ahead and set it up.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:19.760 line:100%
She killed Uncle Ran

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.280 line:100%
and then came to our place.

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:31.800 line:100%
Kiddo, Qiao Suqing's detention
only lasts 24 hours.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:35.360 line:100%
Right now, we've got 13 hours left.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.200 line:100%
Let's cover both sides.

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.080 line:100%
Go find Zhao Jie,

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:40.640 line:100%
coordinate with traffic police,

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.760 line:100%
get footage from back then
near the crash site.

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:43.880 line:100%
Check the surveillance.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:47.280 line:100%
See if Qiao Suqing was there.

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:49.240 line:100%
I'll have a good think about

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:52.560 line:100%
where Ran might've hidden the evidence.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:58.360 line:100%
Kiddo!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.200 line:100%
Don't let anger get the best of you.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.680 line:100%
At this point,

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:10.600 line:100%
this is no longer about solving the case.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.680 line:100%
This is a showdown between us and her.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.160 line:100%
Stay calm.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:23.680 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:27.640 line:100%
I'm a cop first and foremost.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:52.760 line:20%
Ran…

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:56.040 line:100%
Where did you put the evidence?

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:00.240 line:100%
Did Qiao take it?

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:04.600 line:100%
Or was it burned?

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:29.760 line:100%
JIAJIA COLA

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:33.080 line:100%
It's my fault.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.160 line:100%
All my fault.

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:45.680 line:100%
I'm the one who put you in danger.

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:52.800 line:100%
Oh, right.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.040 line:100%
New Year's is next week.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.760 line:100%
On New Year's Eve, come over for dinner.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:17:01.480 line:100%
Bring Qiao too.
We'll all have a family meal.

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:02.600 line:100%
Don't forget.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.639 line:100%
It was me who got you killed.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:26.600 line:100%
Sir,

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.360 line:100%
if it were you,

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.160 line:100%
how would you keep investigating?

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:42.080 line:100%
QIAN DAJUN

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:47.040 line:100%
<i>Officer Ran, I saw Ma Qiang's note.</i>

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.480 line:100%
<i>What do you need?</i>

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.120 line:100%
Manager Qian,

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.840 line:100%
do you know anyone named
Yao Xincheng in Yuanlongli?

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.200 line:100%
<i>Yeah, I know him.</i>

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:57.640 line:100%
<i>Yao Xincheng.</i>

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.280 line:100%
<i>That's him. He kept that woman in 415.</i>

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.280 line:100%
<i>What's her name… Qiao…</i>

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:03.960 line:100%
<i>Qiao Suqing.</i>

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.280 line:20%
RECORD OF INTERROGATION

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.320 line:20%
INTERROGATION RECORD

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.600 line:100%
Captain Zhao,
this is Qian Dajun's interrogation video.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.280 line:100%
Get Qiao Suqing's too.

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:26.480 line:100%
-I want to review everything.
-Got it.

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:30.320 line:100%
Don't you knock?

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:33.040 line:100%
What's wrong, Xiaohe?

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:39.800 line:20%
WEIYANG TRAFFIC MANAGEMENT BUREAU

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:45.720 line:100%
-Wu.
-Qu, what a surprise.

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:48.080 line:100%
-Come sit!
-No, it's fine.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:49.080 line:100%
Need a favor.

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:51.600 line:100%
I need to check all the surveillance

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:53.960 line:100%
from around Jiangdong Road
on New Year's Eve 2003.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:55.480 line:100%
2003?

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:57.280 line:100%
It's not that I won't help.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.960 line:100%
Citywide traffic footage
for one day is massive.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.880 line:100%
We don't even have enough storage
for the past year.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:04.680 line:100%
And you want to check footage
from 12 years ago?

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.280 line:100%
-That's impossible--
-I don't care!

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:07.760 line:100%
Figure it out! I want it checked!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:12.320 line:100%
Twelve years ago,
unresolved crash footage…

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.320 line:100%
Archives might still have it.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:15.560 line:100%
Want to dig through it?

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:17.200 line:100%
-Yes!
-Yes.

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:18.960 line:100%
Captain Qu,

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:21.520 line:100%
on New Year's Eve 2003,

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.360 line:100%
heavy rain, slippery roads,
lots of accidents.

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.600 line:100%
Take your time.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:26.600 line:100%
I'll be next door. Call me if needed.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.600 line:100%
Okay. Thanks.

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:36.560 line:100%
Captain Qu, if Uncle Ran's accident scene

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:38.760 line:100%
was tampered with
by Qiao Suqing beforehand,

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:40.160 line:100%
then start from there

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.120 line:100%
and work outward,
check all roads leading in,

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.520 line:100%
then we might find her.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:44.800 line:100%
Good idea.

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.680 line:20%
I'll dig into it. I've got experience.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:47.760 line:20%
Give me more.

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:57.840 line:100%
Captain Qu,

00:19:58.880 --> 00:19:59.880 line:100%
thank you.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.560 line:100%
No need.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.080 line:100%
Captain Ran wasn't just your uncle,

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.360 line:100%
he was my captain and my partner.

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:09.840 line:100%
This time, no matter what,

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:12.360 line:100%
we'll find out exactly how he died.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:13.800 line:100%
Otherwise,

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.760 line:100%
I don't deserve this badge.

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.320 line:100%
Qu,

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:23.800 line:100%
a New Year's gift.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.120 line:100%
Steep it and drink it. It helps grow hair.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.000 line:100%
Captain, that's so thoughtful. I…

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.240 line:100%
Happy New Year.

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:35.160 line:100%
You too. I'll get going.

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:52.680 line:100%
JIANGDONG WEST ROAD

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.160 line:100%
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:24.800 line:100%
Ran…

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:27.960 line:100%
Where did you put the evidence?

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:31.000 line:100%
Why do I have no clue now?

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:42.240 line:100%
Hey.

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:45.080 line:100%
Mr. He, are you okay?

00:21:45.880 --> 00:21:47.040 line:100%
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:49.200 line:100%
Go handle your work.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:50.640 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:53.640 line:100%
Qu and Xiaohe
are checking traffic footage.

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:56.240 line:100%
<i>I'm reviewing Qiao Suqing's interrogation.</i>

00:21:56.320 --> 00:21:58.400 line:100%
Seeing if she slipped up anywhere.

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:00.000 line:100%
<i>By the way,</i>

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.520 line:100%
Ran's belongings… Who sorted them?

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:04.360 line:100%
<i>Could something be missing?</i>

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:08.160 line:100%
I handled his home myself, personally.

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:09.200 line:100%
Nothing should be missing.

00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:11.960 line:100%
<i>As for police items,</i>
<i>Wang Mangkun sorted them.</i>

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:13.200 line:100%
Need me to ask him?

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:14.440 line:100%
I can have him call you.

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:17.160 line:100%
No need. I'll contact him myself.

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:18.920 line:100%
<i>That's it for now.</i>

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:21.600 line:100%
Mr. He…

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:22.520 line:100%
<i>Go on.</i>

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:25.720 line:100%
You've been through a lot

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:29.160 line:100%
these past two years.

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:33.240 line:100%
<i>You've stuck with this case</i>

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:35.400 line:100%
and his last wish.

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:38.640 line:100%
About this…

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:42.640 line:100%
I feel guilty.

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:46.240 line:100%
I…

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:49.560 line:100%
was too late to realize.

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:54.680 line:100%
<i>I failed as a detective.</i>

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:00.200 line:100%
But don't worry.

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:03.880 line:100%
From now on, I'll give it everything.

00:23:04.600 --> 00:23:07.400 line:100%
<i>I'll do whatever it takes</i>
<i>to find the truth.</i>

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:10.960 line:20%
<i>I won't let the one who killed him go.</i>

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:13.840 line:100%
Nor will I let him

00:23:15.680 --> 00:23:16.920 line:100%
die without answers.

00:23:23.280 --> 00:23:24.360 line:100%
You kid,

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:27.720 line:100%
it's not too late to think like this.

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:30.120 line:100%
<i>Get back to work.</i>

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:32.040 line:100%
<i>I'm hanging up.</i>

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:51.040 line:100%
JIANGDONG WEST ROAD

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:53.360 line:100%
JIANGDONG NORTH ROAD

00:23:55.320 --> 00:23:57.200 line:100%
JAN 31, 2003. 2:35:20 PM
JIANGXI EAST ROAD

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:07.120 line:100%
JAN 31, 2003. 4:24:16 PM
JIANGDONG SOUTH ROAD

00:24:10.200 --> 00:24:11.560 line:100%
JAN 31, 2003. 8:00:06 PM
JIANGXI MID ROAD

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:14.560 line:100%
JAN 31, 2003. 7:30:51 PM
JIANGDONG NORTH ROAD

00:24:19.680 --> 00:24:21.320 line:100%
JAN 31, 2003. 7:26:31 PM
JIANGDONG MID ROAD

00:24:26.840 --> 00:24:27.840 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:30.480 line:100%
take a look.

00:24:31.480 --> 00:24:34.120 line:100%
Can you tell if it's Qiao Suqing?

00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:48.240 line:100%
Don't rush.

00:24:48.320 --> 00:24:49.640 line:100%
Let's keep checking outward.

00:24:50.280 --> 00:24:52.040 line:100%
If not at night, then check daytime.

00:24:52.640 --> 00:24:54.240 line:100%
We'll find her.

00:25:17.640 --> 00:25:19.960 line:100%
MAJOR LANDSLIDE HIT MOUNT WU
IN KUNHAI YESTERDAY

00:25:32.960 --> 00:25:35.160 line:100%
Sir, be careful.

00:25:35.240 --> 00:25:36.960 line:100%
Did you forget about your blood pressure?

00:25:37.920 --> 00:25:40.360 line:100%
Ran, what took you so long?

00:25:40.440 --> 00:25:41.880 line:100%
I've got so much to ask.

00:25:42.480 --> 00:25:44.480 line:100%
Back then, when you found Qiao Suqing,

00:25:45.040 --> 00:25:48.440 line:100%
you must've had solid evidence, right?

00:25:53.400 --> 00:25:55.240 line:100%
Then where did you put it…

00:26:09.560 --> 00:26:11.800 line:100%
Sir, what did you say?

00:26:11.880 --> 00:26:13.040 line:100%
I can't hear you.

00:26:14.560 --> 00:26:15.680 line:100%
I said,

00:26:15.760 --> 00:26:20.440 line:100%
the evidence you used
to identify Qiao Suqing, where is it?

00:26:27.560 --> 00:26:28.400 line:100%
What did you say?

00:26:30.120 --> 00:26:31.200 line:100%
Hold on!

00:26:36.920 --> 00:26:38.000 line:100%
Go ahead!

00:26:40.600 --> 00:26:41.640 line:100%
Oh.

00:26:50.880 --> 00:26:52.800 line:100%
You… Don't worry about me!

00:26:53.560 --> 00:26:55.640 line:100%
I'm doing fine!

00:26:55.720 --> 00:26:57.880 line:100%
Xiaohe's fine too!

00:26:57.960 --> 00:26:59.320 line:100%
Zhao Jie's fine!

00:26:59.400 --> 00:27:01.440 line:100%
We're all doing well!

00:27:01.520 --> 00:27:02.880 line:100%
So don't worry!

00:27:15.920 --> 00:27:16.960 line:100%
Ran…

00:27:23.280 --> 00:27:24.360 line:100%
Ran…

00:27:25.280 --> 00:27:26.560 line:100%
Ran…

00:27:29.440 --> 00:27:30.640 line:100%
Ran…

00:28:09.440 --> 00:28:12.440 line:100%
ICU FAMILY VISITING ROOM

00:28:13.520 --> 00:28:15.480 line:100%
Doctor, how's my dad?

00:28:15.560 --> 00:28:16.400 line:100%
Which one is your dad?

00:28:17.040 --> 00:28:18.400 line:100%
This one.

00:28:18.480 --> 00:28:20.360 line:100%
Don't worry. He's not in danger.

00:28:20.440 --> 00:28:23.240 line:100%
But he has weak vessels,
overworked lately,

00:28:23.320 --> 00:28:25.080 line:100%
and missed his meds,

00:28:25.160 --> 00:28:27.720 line:100%
triggering an ischemic stroke.

00:28:27.800 --> 00:28:29.880 line:100%
He needs to stay for observation.

00:28:29.960 --> 00:28:31.040 line:100%
Thank you, Doctor.

00:28:31.120 --> 00:28:31.960 line:100%
You're welcome.

00:28:33.760 --> 00:28:34.640 line:100%
Manager Ma, thank you.

00:28:34.720 --> 00:28:36.000 line:100%
It's nothing, really.

00:28:36.080 --> 00:28:37.920 line:100%
It's our job.

00:28:38.000 --> 00:28:39.120 line:100%
As long as Yuanlongli stands,

00:28:39.200 --> 00:28:42.240 line:100%
I'll do my duty as property manager.

00:28:42.760 --> 00:28:43.680 line:100%
By the way,

00:28:44.440 --> 00:28:47.120 line:100%
this was in Mr. He's hand
when he collapsed.

00:28:47.200 --> 00:28:49.560 line:100%
It took effort to pry it out.

00:28:50.120 --> 00:28:51.640 line:100%
I'll head back first.

00:28:51.720 --> 00:28:53.320 line:100%
If you need anything, just call me.

00:28:53.920 --> 00:28:55.600 line:100%
-Thanks.
-No problem.

00:29:08.200 --> 00:29:09.280 line:100%
What happened?

00:29:09.360 --> 00:29:10.320 line:100%
I was on the phone with him,

00:29:10.400 --> 00:29:11.320 line:100%
and he suddenly fainted?

00:29:11.400 --> 00:29:12.600 line:100%
Doctor said it's nothing serious.

00:29:12.680 --> 00:29:14.480 line:100%
Just overwork triggering his condition.

00:29:16.240 --> 00:29:17.680 line:100%
That's a relief.

00:29:18.360 --> 00:29:19.400 line:100%
How about this?

00:29:19.480 --> 00:29:21.200 line:100%
Work can wait. Put it aside.

00:29:21.280 --> 00:29:22.640 line:100%
Stay and take care of him.

00:29:22.720 --> 00:29:23.600 line:100%
Captain…

00:29:24.240 --> 00:29:27.400 line:100%
My dad's in there, and I can't help much.

00:29:27.480 --> 00:29:30.600 line:100%
I'd rather work the case
and find the truth.

00:29:34.200 --> 00:29:36.000 line:100%
The June 30 case is reopened.

00:29:36.080 --> 00:29:37.840 line:100%
Xiaohe should lead it.

00:29:37.920 --> 00:29:40.560 line:100%
The team and I will back her up.

00:29:41.560 --> 00:29:42.960 line:100%
And besides, solving it

00:29:43.560 --> 00:29:45.040 line:100%
isn't just Ran's wish,

00:29:45.560 --> 00:29:47.080 line:100%
it's He Yuanhang's too.

00:29:55.320 --> 00:29:56.160 line:100%
Alright.

00:29:56.680 --> 00:29:58.000 line:100%
Talk to the doctor,

00:29:58.080 --> 00:29:59.840 line:100%
-then get back ASAP.
-Thank you, Captain.

00:30:05.840 --> 00:30:07.760 line:100%
Before I came, I found another clip.

00:30:07.840 --> 00:30:10.520 line:100%
Same woman with the umbrella.
I copied it for you.

00:30:11.120 --> 00:30:12.760 line:100%
Two drives left to check.

00:30:12.840 --> 00:30:13.960 line:100%
I'll head back and continue.

00:30:14.560 --> 00:30:15.400 line:100%
Captain Qu!

00:30:17.720 --> 00:30:18.920 line:100%
Thank you.

00:30:20.800 --> 00:30:22.040 line:100%
What's with you?

00:30:22.120 --> 00:30:23.440 line:100%
Thanking me twice today.

00:30:24.480 --> 00:30:27.640 line:100%
Last time, it was for my uncle.

00:30:28.760 --> 00:30:31.600 line:100%
This time, it's for my dad.

00:30:40.160 --> 00:30:42.400 line:100%
The two of us worked together for years.

00:30:44.200 --> 00:30:45.600 line:100%
Seeing him now,

00:30:46.120 --> 00:30:48.480 line:100%
lying there against his will…

00:30:50.240 --> 00:30:51.560 line:100%
It just

00:30:52.920 --> 00:30:54.360 line:100%
doesn't feel good.

00:31:03.040 --> 00:31:05.160 line:100%
When he's better, tell him

00:31:05.760 --> 00:31:07.200 line:100%
he owes me one.

00:31:08.320 --> 00:31:09.360 line:100%
I'm off.

00:31:11.160 --> 00:31:12.600 line:100%
Captain Qu!

00:31:41.040 --> 00:31:44.160 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST

00:31:44.240 --> 00:31:45.480 line:100%
<i>This whole explanation,</i>

00:31:46.000 --> 00:31:48.720 line:100%
<i>you must've planned for years, didn't you?</i>

00:31:49.840 --> 00:31:50.880 line:100%
<i>Xiaohe.</i>

00:31:54.800 --> 00:31:55.680 line:100%
JULY 1, WEDNESDAY

00:31:55.760 --> 00:31:58.800 line:100%
<i>I even admitted I pushed my own mother</i>
<i>off a cliff by accident.</i>

00:31:58.880 --> 00:32:00.400 line:100%
<i>I told you that myself.</i>

00:32:00.920 --> 00:32:03.040 line:100%
<i>So making up anything else,</i>
<i>what would be the point?</i>

00:32:13.840 --> 00:32:15.360 line:100%
CAPTAIN'S OFFICE

00:32:18.040 --> 00:32:19.640 line:100%
Captain, reporting in.

00:32:19.720 --> 00:32:21.760 line:100%
Qiao Suqing is assisting now.

00:32:21.840 --> 00:32:23.120 line:100%
If we can't detain her,

00:32:23.200 --> 00:32:25.680 line:100%
in three hours, the hold expires.

00:32:25.760 --> 00:32:27.480 line:100%
Then we'll have to release her?

00:32:27.560 --> 00:32:29.240 line:100%
Why so eager?

00:32:29.320 --> 00:32:30.280 line:100%
We've got three hours.

00:32:30.360 --> 00:32:32.000 line:100%
Get out! Don't bother me!

00:32:32.760 --> 00:32:33.640 line:100%
Okay.

00:32:44.400 --> 00:32:47.400 line:100%
COMPREHENSIVE SOCIAL SECURITY MANAGEMENT

00:32:55.440 --> 00:32:58.200 line:100%
Qu said you made some progress
with the surveillance.

00:32:58.280 --> 00:32:59.560 line:100%
Why are you just sitting here?

00:33:00.160 --> 00:33:02.080 line:100%
The footage, it's just a lead.

00:33:02.600 --> 00:33:04.240 line:100%
We still lack proof.

00:33:05.840 --> 00:33:07.960 line:100%
This note my dad wrote
before he collapsed…

00:33:08.040 --> 00:33:09.760 line:100%
I keep thinking,

00:33:09.840 --> 00:33:12.840 line:100%
could it be linked to what
Uncle Ran found?

00:33:19.600 --> 00:33:22.480 line:100%
Captain Zhao said before Mr. He collapsed,

00:33:23.000 --> 00:33:26.080 line:100%
he asked about Ran's belongings.

00:33:26.160 --> 00:33:29.120 line:100%
Back then, I handled that.

00:33:29.640 --> 00:33:31.680 line:100%
I even went back and checked again.

00:33:31.760 --> 00:33:33.280 line:100%
It was all routine files.

00:33:33.360 --> 00:33:38.720 line:100%
Whether paper or digital,
nothing stood out.

00:33:43.520 --> 00:33:45.120 line:100%
Digital…

00:33:47.160 --> 00:33:48.320 line:100%
The office system?

00:33:48.400 --> 00:33:49.520 line:100%
No way.

00:33:49.600 --> 00:33:53.240 line:100%
I took over his account
and internal email.

00:33:53.920 --> 00:33:55.480 line:100%
Nothing unusual.

00:33:55.560 --> 00:33:57.440 line:100%
I remember that morning,

00:33:57.520 --> 00:33:59.120 line:100%
he rushed back,

00:33:59.200 --> 00:34:01.560 line:100%
didn't even greet anyone,
and went straight into his office.

00:34:01.640 --> 00:34:03.040 line:100%
Wait… I remember.

00:34:03.120 --> 00:34:04.840 line:100%
<i>I went in that day.</i>

00:34:05.360 --> 00:34:06.840 line:100%
It's New Year… Why are you still busy?

00:34:07.640 --> 00:34:08.600 line:100%
Nothing.

00:34:09.240 --> 00:34:11.479 line:100%
Writing a case summary email.

00:34:11.560 --> 00:34:12.400 line:100%
What case?

00:34:12.479 --> 00:34:13.560 line:100%
I never heard of it.

00:34:15.720 --> 00:34:20.120 line:100%
He was at his desk, said he was writing
a case summary email.

00:34:20.720 --> 00:34:23.360 line:100%
That day, did any of you get his email?

00:34:28.160 --> 00:34:30.240 line:100%
Could it be an internal email to my dad?

00:34:30.320 --> 00:34:31.479 line:100%
No.

00:34:31.560 --> 00:34:33.560 line:100%
Back then, he never used computers.

00:34:33.640 --> 00:34:36.600 line:100%
His system account and internal email…

00:34:36.680 --> 00:34:37.680 line:100%
He never used them.

00:34:38.959 --> 00:34:41.600 line:100%
But the system account
is just full-name pinyin.

00:34:43.120 --> 00:34:46.680 line:100%
Wait, you handle retired accounts, right?

00:34:46.760 --> 00:34:47.640 line:100%
Captain,

00:34:48.560 --> 00:34:53.120 line:100%
I actually came across Mr. He's account
while organizing the system.

00:34:53.200 --> 00:34:55.160 line:100%
What are you waiting for? Log in, now.

00:34:55.240 --> 00:34:56.800 line:100%
After I saw it,

00:34:57.920 --> 00:34:59.360 line:100%
I deleted it.

00:35:00.120 --> 00:35:01.480 line:100%
Why so eager?

00:35:10.680 --> 00:35:14.080 line:100%
Liu, can you restore a deleted account?

00:35:14.160 --> 00:35:15.760 line:100%
<i>A deleted account,</i>

00:35:15.840 --> 00:35:17.240 line:100%
<i>if it needs recovery,</i>

00:35:17.320 --> 00:35:19.760 line:100%
<i>we'd have to send the main drive</i>
<i>to the city IT center.</i>

00:35:19.840 --> 00:35:21.280 line:100%
That won't work. How long would that take?

00:35:21.360 --> 00:35:22.560 line:100%
I need it now.

00:35:22.640 --> 00:35:24.680 line:100%
<i>Captain, that's beyond us.</i>

00:35:24.760 --> 00:35:27.360 line:100%
<i>We're cops, not hackers.</i>

00:35:32.840 --> 00:35:33.760 line:100%
Hackers?

00:35:35.760 --> 00:35:38.320 line:100%
Check up and down, left and right…

00:35:38.840 --> 00:35:41.160 line:100%
-He's a hacker.
-A hacker?

00:35:42.000 --> 00:35:43.360 line:100%
I'm not a hacker.

00:35:43.440 --> 00:35:45.640 line:100%
You got the wrong guy. I'm innocent.

00:35:45.720 --> 00:35:47.480 line:100%
-Take him first!
-Move!

00:35:47.560 --> 00:35:49.080 line:100%
-Wait…
-Come on.

00:35:49.160 --> 00:35:50.400 line:100%
Where? My computer…

00:35:50.480 --> 00:35:51.760 line:100%
Where are we going?

00:36:00.200 --> 00:36:03.320 line:100%
POLICE USE ONLY

00:36:10.200 --> 00:36:11.520 line:100%
Relax.

00:36:11.600 --> 00:36:12.960 line:100%
We just need help on data recovery.

00:36:13.040 --> 00:36:14.440 line:100%
It's approved.

00:36:14.520 --> 00:36:15.840 line:100%
Handled technically.

00:36:15.920 --> 00:36:18.120 line:100%
It's all legal and secure.

00:36:19.080 --> 00:36:20.080 line:100%
Make way!

00:36:20.160 --> 00:36:21.800 line:100%
Here's fuel for him.

00:36:21.880 --> 00:36:23.360 line:100%
Here. Drink up.

00:36:40.800 --> 00:36:43.600 line:100%
The system's hard drive… ever replaced?

00:36:43.680 --> 00:36:44.800 line:100%
No.

00:36:45.760 --> 00:36:47.000 line:100%
Five minutes.

00:37:21.480 --> 00:37:22.800 line:100%
ENTER PASSWORD

00:37:25.960 --> 00:37:27.240 line:100%
The data's still there.

00:37:28.320 --> 00:37:29.600 line:20%
It's encrypted.

00:37:30.120 --> 00:37:31.400 line:20%
If you don't know the password,

00:37:31.480 --> 00:37:33.520 line:20%
I can install a hacking tool

00:37:33.600 --> 00:37:35.280 line:100%
-and crack it.
-Are you crazy?

00:37:35.360 --> 00:37:37.720 line:100%
Installing random software
on police computers?

00:37:37.800 --> 00:37:39.320 line:100%
You want jail time?

00:37:45.000 --> 00:37:46.080 line:100%
I'll try.

00:37:54.840 --> 00:37:56.320 line:100%
ENTER PASSWORD

00:37:56.400 --> 00:37:57.240 line:100%
ERROR

00:38:00.680 --> 00:38:02.040 line:100%
I'll try a birthday.

00:38:02.120 --> 00:38:07.840 line:100%
ENTER PASSWORD

00:38:07.920 --> 00:38:08.680 line:100%
ERROR

00:38:13.960 --> 00:38:15.360 line:100%
Wait!

00:38:15.440 --> 00:38:16.960 line:100%
Last try.

00:38:17.040 --> 00:38:18.160 line:100%
One more and it locks.

00:38:37.480 --> 00:38:39.280 line:100%
Your teacher said

00:38:39.960 --> 00:38:41.560 line:100%
you ranked

00:38:42.160 --> 00:38:43.280 line:100%
last in finals.

00:38:46.480 --> 00:38:47.920 line:100%
Last place is fine.

00:38:48.440 --> 00:38:49.560 line:100%
Not so bad.

00:38:52.080 --> 00:38:53.600 line:100%
Last place and still fine?

00:38:54.600 --> 00:38:55.520 line:100%
Tell me…

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:59.920 line:100%
If someone stands on Earth
and keeps walking south,

00:39:00.520 --> 00:39:01.520 line:100%
where do they end up?

00:39:03.320 --> 00:39:05.080 line:100%
Keep going south…

00:39:06.280 --> 00:39:07.280 line:100%
as far south as possible.

00:39:11.960 --> 00:39:14.480 line:100%
You'll reach the South Pole.

00:39:15.080 --> 00:39:17.080 line:100%
But once you're there,

00:39:17.160 --> 00:39:20.160 line:100%
any direction you go
won't be south anymore.

00:39:21.920 --> 00:39:24.840 line:100%
Xiaohe, we're both at the bottom.

00:39:26.080 --> 00:39:28.480 line:100%
Your birthday's March 31.

00:39:29.000 --> 00:39:30.880 line:100%
Mine's June 30.

00:39:31.800 --> 00:39:33.480 line:100%
Last day of the month.

00:39:34.080 --> 00:39:35.560 line:100%
But think of it…

00:39:36.320 --> 00:39:40.320 line:100%
The next day after our birthdays
is always a new month.

00:39:41.880 --> 00:39:43.360 line:100%
I like that.

00:39:51.360 --> 00:39:52.760 line:100%
It's my dad's account.

00:39:53.280 --> 00:39:56.040 line:100%
Uncle Ran wouldn't use his own birthday.

00:40:00.880 --> 00:40:03.640 line:100%
ENTER PASSWORD

00:40:06.920 --> 00:40:07.880 line:100%
GOOD EVENING, HE YUANHANG

00:40:09.280 --> 00:40:10.360 line:100%
Got it!

00:40:16.280 --> 00:40:18.280 line:100%
INBOX: 0 UNREAD

00:40:19.720 --> 00:40:21.440 line:100%
There's nothing.

00:40:23.000 --> 00:40:23.840 line:100%
Check drafts.

00:40:25.520 --> 00:40:27.520 line:100%
DRAFTS

00:40:27.600 --> 00:40:28.720 line:100%
JUNE 30 CASE REINVESTIGATION REPORT

00:40:33.920 --> 00:40:38.160 line:100%
"Dear leaders, colleagues,
this is He Yuanhang."

00:40:38.240 --> 00:40:40.800 line:100%
<i>As a recognized contributor</i>
<i>to the June 30 case,</i>

00:40:41.320 --> 00:40:44.560 line:100%
<i>I have a duty to report the findings</i>

00:40:44.640 --> 00:40:46.680 line:100%
<i>of the reinvestigation as follows…</i>

00:40:48.440 --> 00:40:50.960 line:100%
He already wrote a report.

00:40:51.040 --> 00:40:52.560 line:100%
Why keep investigating?

00:40:53.600 --> 00:40:54.880 line:100%
He lost his memory.

00:40:55.880 --> 00:40:57.000 line:100%
What do you know?

00:40:57.080 --> 00:40:58.200 line:100%
This must have been written
by Captain Ran.

00:40:58.280 --> 00:41:00.760 line:100%
He didn't want to affect
He Yuanhang's merit award,

00:41:00.840 --> 00:41:04.000 line:100%
so he put the credit on He Yuanhang.

00:41:05.960 --> 00:41:08.400 line:100%
JUNE 30 EVIDENCE

00:41:11.280 --> 00:41:12.120 line:100%
JUNE 30 EVIDENCE

00:41:12.200 --> 00:41:14.000 line:100%
EVIDENCE LIST, EVIDENCE LOCATIONS

00:41:14.080 --> 00:41:16.080 line:100%
EVIDENCE LIST

00:41:20.880 --> 00:41:21.720 line:100%
PROPERTY PICTURE OF EVIDENCE

00:41:21.800 --> 00:41:22.920 line:100%
DRESS

00:41:23.000 --> 00:41:24.200 line:100%
OCTAGONAL LAMPSHADE

00:41:24.280 --> 00:41:25.280 line:100%
CEMENT FRAGMENTS

00:41:27.400 --> 00:41:28.480 line:100%
EVIDENCE LOCATIONS

00:41:36.320 --> 00:41:37.600 line:100%
Captain Ran's toolbox.

00:41:39.080 --> 00:41:40.320 line:100%
It's at my place.

00:42:10.400 --> 00:42:11.440 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:42:12.360 --> 00:42:13.680 line:100%
what are you doing here?

00:42:29.120 --> 00:42:30.360 line:100%
Who are you looking for?

00:42:36.840 --> 00:42:38.240 line:100%
Can we talk inside?